    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323520/extras/f29a07b9c20caf66ed7a88e27bb93767.poster.avif?t=1748979622\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323520/extras/f29a07b9c20caf66ed7a88e27bb93767.webm?t=1748979622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323520/extras/05e9f0c5b7c7fe4c0a3b823166195037.avif?t=1748979622\" /></span><br>Dark Life: Excalibur is a fantasy action adventure that tells the story of Aron, a human linked to the most famous and legendary sword of all time: Excalibur. Aron must find peace through his family's vengeance and to do so he must discover why York, the lord of the giants, destroyed everything he fought for. To confront the beings that pursue him, he must forge a sword capable of killing gods, without knowing that it would become the most legendary sword of all time, but also the one that has shed the most blood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323520/extras/19b1887f3b7247a247b55ac9383af22f.avif?t=1748979622\" /></span><br><br>Forge the darkest and most violent legend of Excalibur with this title, a tribute made by and for Souls saga lovers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323520/extras/85546fe3c64359be80b963867873e48e.avif?t=1748979622\" /></span><br><br>In the world of Dark Life: Excalibur, bestiality is a power that accumulates in the hearts of the beings that inhabit it. By killing enemies, you can accumulate bestiality in the form of fragments, which can be used to buy upgrades, level up and improve parts of your Excalibur sword to build its own structure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323520/extras/57e575336a1bc4b0d7c74748907a2b42.avif?t=1748979622\" /></span><br><br>The game is divided into zones that you must overcome by exploring to improve Aron and Excalibur's stats.<br><br>Each zone will have a final boss and mini bosses that are part of the story. Finishing them is a necessary challenge to accomplish your goal. You will encounter puzzles as well as frantic combat and sometimes you will be overwhelmed by the difficulty of certain enemies.",
